{#- A changelog list from a data file in site/_data/changelog/<tool>.json. Expects `entries`: an array of
    {date, type, summary, details}, newest first. `type` is one of the kinds in docs/COUNTY-PROFILES.md
    ("Kinds of change"): "method" (the documented method changed), "correction" (figures moved, the method
    did not) or "tooling" (no figure moved). The `changelogKind` filter gives the label and fails the build on
    any other type, so only a tooling entry can read "No figure moved". -#}
<dl class="cp-reasons about-changelog">
{%- for e in entries %}
<div><dt>{{ e.summary }} <span class="cp-muted"><time datetime="{{ e.date }}">{{ e.date }}</time> · {{ e.type | changelogKind }}</span></dt><dd>{{ e.details }}</dd></div>
{%- endfor %}
</dl>
